* Done leaves the part at once. Here it passes over the numbers that are
* not wanted; the for goes on to the next value.
1.1 Done if fp(n/3) = 0.
1.2 Done if fp(n/5) = 0.
1.3 Type n in form 1.
Form 1:
__ divides by neither 3 nor 5
